  "loudestFinding": {
    "statement": "36 of the 79 proven families this sweep actually rebuilt do NOT reproduce their committed output — 35 at COMPLETE_PACKET_PROVEN and 1 at VERIFIED_PASS. Every one of them is in a state the factory currently relies on. 43 reproduce exactly.",
    "whyItMatters": "A family whose committed artifacts are not what its builder produces has no reproducible provenance. A raster receipt pinned over such bytes binds bytes the owning script no longer authors, so the visual gate's evidence is not regenerable and the proven state rests on a snapshot nobody can rebuild.",
