    "script": "scripts/grade-a-packet-factory-24h/measure-build-reproducibility.mjs",
    "output": "data/rcap-grade-a/fable-packet-factory/BUILD_REPRODUCIBILITY.json",
    "whatItDoes": "for each family with a directory and an owning build script: SHA-256 every committed file in the output directory, rebuild through the family's OWN script, hash again, classify, and restore the working tree with git checkout of named paths, verifying byte-identical restoration before the next family",
    "invocationDetermination": "per script, never assumed: an importer that calls run*FamilyCli(\"<id>\"), a host whose direct-invocation guard defaults to its own family, or runIfMain(FAMILY, import.meta.url) on the composed-pleading host. Anything else records UNKNOWN_INVOCATION rather than guessing.",
    "nondeterminismTest": "a rebuild that differs from committed is rebuilt a second consecutive time; only a rebuild that is stable across two consecutive runs is called DIVERGES"
  },
